Package: sns
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SiNS Team <admin@home.net>
Depends: dotnet-runtime-9.0 | dotnet-runtime-8.0 | dotnet-runtime-7.0
Description: SiNS DNS Server CLI Tool (sns)
 A command-line interface for managing the SiNS DNS Server via its REST API.
 .
 Features:
  * DNS Record Management (CRUD operations)
  * Cache Management (view and clear cache)
  * System Management (health checks, statistics, configuration)
  * User Management (authentication and administration)
  * Cross-platform support (Windows, macOS, Linux)
  * Modern CLI with colored output and formatted tables
 .
 The CLI tool provides comprehensive functionality for all aspects
 of DNS server management, from basic health checks to complex
 configuration management.
